(FLEXWOLF - Admin and Mobile Operations Guide) Tj T*
/F1 9 Tf
(Updated 22 September 2026) Tj T*
/F1 9 Tf
() Tj T*
/F2 10 Tf
(CURRENT DELIVERY) Tj T*
/F1 9 Tf
(Customer sign up, login and logout use Firebase Authentication in the mobile app.) Tj T*
/F1 9 Tf
(An account is required before adding a product to the bag or opening checkout.) Tj T*
/F1 9 Tf
(Shopify Checkout Kit opens payment inside the Android app. The iOS bridge is pending.) Tj T*
/F1 9 Tf
(Loox review writing opens the official Loox product form inside an app WebView.) Tj T*
/F1 9 Tf
(Loox APIs are read-only, so native API submission and moderation are unavailable.) Tj T*
/F1 9 Tf
() Tj T*
/F2 10 Tf
(ADMIN LOGIN SETUP) Tj T*
/F1 9 Tf
(1. Enable Email/Password in Firebase Authentication and create the admin user.) Tj T*
/F1 9 Tf
(2. From a trusted computer with Firebase Admin SDK credentials, run:) Tj T*
/F1 9 Tf
(   cd functions) Tj T*
/F1 9 Tf
(   node grant_admin.js admin@example.com) Tj T*
/F1 9 Tf
(3. The script grants the custom claim admin=true. Sign out and sign in again.) Tj T*
/F1 9 Tf
(4. Open the Admin Portal in the FLEXWOLF app and enter those Firebase credentials.) Tj T*
/F1 9 Tf
(5. Never put Shopify Admin secrets or a Firebase service account in the APK.) Tj T*
/F1 9 Tf
() Tj T*
/F2 10 Tf
(ADMIN DASHBOARD) Tj T*
/F1 9 Tf
(Open Dashboard > Store. The four tabs are Products, Orders, Firebase users, Push.) Tj T*
/F1 9 Tf
(Products: enter a title and positive price, then tap Create draft product.) Tj T*
/F1 9 Tf
(Shopify creates a DRAFT and updates the default variant price.) Tj T*
/F1 9 Tf
(Add media, inventory, options and sales channel publication in Shopify Admin.) Tj T*
/F1 9 Tf
(To change a listed variant price, expand its product and tap the edit icon.) Tj T*
/F1 9 Tf
(Orders: recent 30 Shopify orders show total, payment and fulfillment status.) Tj T*
/F1 9 Tf
(The screen currently displays orders; fulfillment, capture, refund and cancellation) Tj T*
/F1 9 Tf
(must still be performed in Shopify Admin until supported server actions exist.) Tj T*
/F1 9 Tf
(Firebase users: recent first 100 Auth users are shown with UID and disabled state.) Tj T*
/F1 9 Tf
(Push: enter title and message, then Send push notification. Signed-in customers) Tj T*
/F1 9 Tf
(who allowed notifications and registered a token receive the FCM topic message.) Tj T*
/F1 9 Tf
(Use a test message first; sending to the topic cannot be undone.) Tj T*
/F1 9 Tf
() Tj T*
/F2 10 Tf
(BACKEND DEPLOYMENT) Tj T*
/F1 9 Tf
(Firebase Functions must be deployed to project flexwolf-mobile-app in us-central1.) Tj T*
/F1 9 Tf
(The project must support Functions and Secret Manager \(Blaze billing is required\).) Tj T*
/F1 9 Tf
(Set SHOPIFY_STORE_DOMAIN and SHOPIFY_ADMIN_API_VERSION=2026-07 for Functions.) Tj T*
/F1 9 Tf
(Set the Shopify client secret as a Firebase secret:) Tj T*
/F1 9 Tf
(   firebase functions:secrets:set SHOPIFY_API_SECRET) Tj T*
/F1 9 Tf
(Shopify Admin tokens are generated and refreshed by Functions on the server.) Tj T*
/F1 9 Tf
(The client credentials grant requires the app to act on its own organization store.) Tj T*
/F1 9 Tf
(Deploy after setting the secret:) Tj T*
/F1 9 Tf
(   firebase deploy --only functions) Tj T*
/F1 9 Tf
(The Shopify app needs read_products, write_products and read_orders scopes.) Tj T*
/F1 9 Tf
(If customer syncing is enabled, add read_customers and write_customers.) Tj T*
/F1 9 Tf
(Admin actions use Firebase verified ID tokens and require admin=true custom claim.) Tj T*
/F1 9 Tf
(The Shopify Admin GraphQL HTTP proxy also requires that admin token.) Tj T*
/F1 9 Tf
(Shopify API client ID and secret are exchanged server-side for an Admin token.) Tj T*
/F1 9 Tf
() Tj T*
/F2 10 Tf
(MOBILE CHECKS) Tj T*
/F1 9 Tf
(Build and launch the app on a device. Test Firebase sign up, sign in and logout.) Tj T*
